"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"1c55bb2702fa4fbbccbf21057d344240744b5041","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/1c55bb2702fa4fbbccbf21057d344240744b5041","html_url":"https://github.com/openai/codex/commit/1c55bb2702fa4fbbccbf21057d344240744b5041"}]},{"sha":"1c55bb2702fa4fbbccbf21057d344240744b5041","node_id":"C_kwDOOYsS4doAKDFjNTViYjI3MDJmYTRmYmJjY2JmMjEwNTdkMzQ0MjQwNzQ0YjUwNDE","commit":{"author":{"name":"jif-oai","email":"jif@openai.com","date":"2026-05-29T11:32:19Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-29T11:32:19Z"},"message":"[codex] Improve built-in tool schema docs (#24794)\n\n## Summary\n- Clarify default, omission, and bounded behavior across built-in tool\nschemas, including unified exec, classic shell, Code Mode exec/wait,\nmulti-agent, agent job, MCP resource, image, goal, plan, tool_search,\nand test-sync fields.\n- Convert update_plan status to an enum and add short field descriptions\nwhere the schema previously relied on surrounding context.\n- Remove the dedicated permission-approval schema test and keep only\nupdates to existing expected-spec tests.\n\n## Validation\n- Ran `just fmt`.\n- Ran `git diff --check`.\n- Did not run clippy or tests, per request.\n\nRegression has been eval\n[here](https://openai.slack.com/archives/C09GDSP1J9X/p1779905065496949)\nand we proved there are no regressions","tree":{"sha":"4fd148b44ea04499ac742fcbe941d2a028f608b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/trees/4fd148b44ea04499ac742fcbe941d2a028f608b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/git/commits/1c55bb2702fa4fbbccbf21057d344240744b5041","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGXlDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAO88QAA1FE8ZUm7qIJ+S+3GkoFghQ\nB1rQPDqXcarotxkQdStvoQGYRIV4qqhLOT1pyedYoQi+DB/hK6iKSDXrdoCd05+W\nizbj3E0YLNyo8perC8LvBl0r14ykDsmt6Pkd298q0RZKiESiQbfjDSl1UQOkLEMf\nCoS5LY/xBL1s+LsbW0IEQsnwoM4JX5K80vMxKR4Vanjk/Tu1mraLHQEswSk7gc7q\ntS9TZf3+YDVik6O80lfUbtUItQtD/PGyHUU94oG4eRrwiSmaStfS9FQwDFTsvHvP\nPD14ESvuvPFnpjm6MXWujwGdaCJjTlVQMX1VfICx1rLyLQCCdNCCA9unTNoJr/94\n61tcm4Nn31kuaIpb0CZNNkCIML5dj0d4IwNmNPU/YmiN5Z8tzOmmaZZY8lH09Y6W\nG2+qcv+HZPVVldAYqz92UH3jZR7Yt097/1zByUk1Q7YWCOjNCwuzOw72LcNMklO5\nh656vUeS3KW1M7PQIBk1aQw8mnnl2BXM4VZ7PcQ7nC+Vh2rJ7qZaIbCELK2edZMB\noYyx5FKYjQgrK+Uq7L00zRWlRMRwPe5tLcPC4rw6As4tbQjHAFLISKKOB3wAaSCW\n08ay1bI9dUd+Vk/HFrYtQX/su4pn2iU1/FQlYh4Vq5CYGXVf6nLbQ8jh6JDCmTN8\nU1n3+jXAt9yyQKO4GfDH\n=IiiC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 4fd148b44ea04499ac742fcbe941d2a028f608b2\nparent 3deda3116c12a3a53e0739bda1318d7e709443f8\nauthor jif-oai <jif@openai.com> 1780054339 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780054339 +0200\n\n[codex] Improve built-in tool schema docs (#24794)\n\n## Summary\n- Clarify default, omission, and bounded behavior across built-in tool\nschemas, including unified exec, classic shell, Code Mode exec/wait,\nmulti-agent, agent job, MCP resource, image, goal, plan, tool_search,\nand test-sync fields.\n- Convert update_plan status to an enum and add short field descriptions\nwhere the schema previously relied on surrounding context.\n- Remove the dedicated permission-approval schema test and keep only\nupdates to existing expected-spec tests.\n\n## Validation\n- Ran `just fmt`.\n- Ran `git diff --check`.\n- Did not run clippy or tests, per request.\n\nRegression has been eval\n[here](https://openai.slack.com/archives/C09GDSP1J9X/p1779905065496949)\nand we proved there are no regressions","verified_at":"2026-05-29T11:32:20Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openai/codex/commits/1c55bb2702fa4fbbccbf21057d344240744b5041",